      "title": "Amendment 4 date is after Amendment 3 date, but Amendment 3 is dated 15 February 2021 and Amendment 4 is dated 06 January 2022, which is chronologically correct; however, the protocol header on page 180 says 'Date: 06 January 2022 Page 1 of 12' while the amendment 3 header on page 182 says 'Date: 15 February 2021 Page 1 of 1' – no contradiction. But the protocol title on page 180 says 'AMG 510' while on page 185 it says 'Sotorasib (AMG 510)' – inconsistent naming.",
